{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Update :</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >26.02.23 - Demo ver 1.1 Update</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >26.02.25 - Character Unu damage bug fix</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The knight \u2018Ail Shell\u2019 lost his memory. He awoke in a dungeon where everything was decided by dice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There he met the witch, \u2018Grin\u2019. Ail gained the aid of \u2018Grin\u2019, who freely manipulates fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To rescue someone trapped in the dungeon and escape himself,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and to recover his lost memories, Ail heads deeper into the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022200/extras/361b36eb549d51e0e85d17b084603485.poster.avif?t=1772329007\" width=712 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022200/extras/361b36eb549d51e0e85d17b084603485.webm?t=1772329007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022200/extras/361b36eb549d51e0e85d17b084603485.mp4?t=1772329007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roll, manipulate, roll, manipulate!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this dice-driven adventure, you must actively use Grin's magic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use fate magic to reroll the dice or even change the numbers themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The outcome will reshape your future adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022200/extras/7fa5c03685696edd6d51d6dca4efb149.poster.avif?t=1772329007\" width=712 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022200/extras/7fa5c03685696edd6d51d6dca4efb149.webm?t=1772329007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022200/extras/7fa5c03685696edd6d51d6dca4efb149.mp4?t=1772329007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn-based combat where dice manipulation overturns the tide of victory!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using skills always requires the right fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's why both allies and enemies must use dice to activate abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 'Grin's magic, you can freely manipulate these dice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the fate needed to unleash even the hardest-to-use skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, enemy dice are no exception!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022200/extras/5eb0ad28ee5a044e2f668b5aa1d2bf77.poster.avif?t=1772329007\" width=710 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022200/extras/5eb0ad28ee5a044e2f668b5aa1d2bf77.webm?t=1772329007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022200/extras/5eb0ad28ee5a044e2f668b5aa1d2bf77.mp4?t=1772329007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What awaits you at the end of your adventure...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your past, revealed as you reclaim your memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unknown plans of \u2018Grin\u2019.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within this dungeon, tangled beyond even magic's reach,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where exactly will your destiny flow?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022200/extras/6b79facb34fab778e9df282d00c87ede.poster.avif?t=1772329007\" width=712 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022200/extras/6b79facb34fab778e9df282d00c87ede.webm?t=1772329007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022200/extras/6b79facb34fab778e9df282d00c87ede.mp4?t=1772329007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4022200?t=1772329007","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4022200?t=1772329007","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022200/33ad2809125c8321286bf024170f0d228e86d715/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772329007","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022200/33ad2809125c8321286bf024170f0d228e86d715/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772329007","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4022590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Update :</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >26.02.23 - Demo ver 1.1 Update</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >26.02.25 - Character Unu damage bug fix</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The knight \u2018Ail Shell\u2019 lost his memory. He awoke in a dungeon where everything was decided by dice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There he met the witch, \u2018Grin\u2019. Ail gained the aid of \u2018Grin\u2019, who freely manipulates fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To rescue someone trapped in the dungeon and escape himself,</p>