 >That's why both allies and enemies must use dice to activate abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 'Grin's magic, you can freely manipulate these dice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the fate needed to unleash even the hardest-to-use skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, enemy dice are no exception!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022200/extras/5eb0ad28ee5a044e2f668b5aa1d2bf77.poster.avif?t=1772329007\" width=710 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022200/extras/5eb0ad28ee5a044e2f668b5aa1d2bf77.webm?t=1772329007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022200/extras/5eb0ad28ee5a044e2f668b5aa1d2bf77.mp4?t=1772329007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What awaits you at the end of your adventure...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your past, revealed as you reclaim your memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unknown plans of \u2018Grin\u2019.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within this dungeon, tangled beyond even magic's reach,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where exactly will your destiny flow?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022200/extras/6b79facb34fab778e9df282d00c87ede.poster.avif?t=1772329007\" width=712 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022200/extras/6b79facb34fab778e9df282d00c87ede.webm?t=1772329007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022200/extras/6b79facb34fab778e9df282d00c87ede.mp4?t=1772329007\"